        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur FAVBCC19ENTR, Keyed Baguette Crystal Knob with Fifth Avenue Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Baguette Crystal Knob with Fifth Avenue Plate Entry is available with either a clear crystal knob or an amber Baguette Knob. The Fifth Avenue Plate comes in a wide array of finish options so you can create a look that is all you. The Keyed Baguette Crystal Knob with Fifth Avenue Plate is a single cylinder door lock, meaning the door is opened by a thumb latch on the exterior and by a knob on the interior. On the deadbolt, there is a keyed lock cylinder for use on the outside of the door while a thumb turn is used to lock the door on the interior. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A knob operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWant your entire house to have matching hardware? Also Available <a href=\"/products/baguette-crystal-knob-with-fifth-avenue-plate-grandeur-favbcc19\"><b>Baguette Knob with Fifth Avenue Tall Plate for Interior Doors</b></a> in Privacy, Passage, and Dummy Functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur Baguette Knob with Fifth Avenue Tall Plate Keyed Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage \"C\"</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Keyed Entry Set Baguette Crystal Knob with Tall Fifth Avenue Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Material: Crystal</li>\r\n<li>Plate Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Height: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: .39\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-FAVBCC19ENTR-specifications.pdf?v=1704262394\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur FAVBCC19ENTR Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
